OL,3,AMusk and Anthropic pledge public share
OL,4,Agiveaways
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk's SpaceX and artificial
OL,7,Fintelligence giant Anthropic have
OL,8,Fpledged big financial giveaways as Big
OL,9,FTech firms come under pressure over the
OL,10,Fpotential impact of AI on humanity.
OL,12,FMusk said on Monday that he would give
OL,13,Fone of his shares at his rocket
OL,14,Fcompany, which owns xAI, to every child
OL,15,Fin America next year.
OL,17,FThe billionaire's announcement came
OL,18,Fafter Anthropic said it would commit 5%
OL,19,Fof its shares to a fund that will make
OL,20,Fdonations for the "public good".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
