OL,3,ASelena Gomez says vaping has affected
OL,4,Aher voice
OL,5,
OL,6,FSelena Gomez has said vaping nicotine
OL,7,Fhas changed the way her voice sounds.
OL,9,F"I'm not gonna be able to change my
OL,10,Fvoice," the singer, 34, said in a
OL,11,Fcandid Instagram post on Sunday. "I
OL,12,Fvaped nicotine a lot."
OL,14,F"Nicotine is so hard to quit and I just
OL,15,Fwanted to say, if you're going through
OL,16,Fit, or if you're even trying to vape,
OL,17,Fit's just not worth it," she continued.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
